OL,3,GNEWSASea harvest service celebrates
OL,4,Afishing industry
OL,5,
OL,6,FLove British Food chief executive
OL,7,FAlexia Robinson said it was "only
OL,8,Ffitting that we now also celebrate the
OL,9,Fharvest of our seas" and the fishers
OL,10,Fwho provide "sustainable, nutritious
OL,11,Fseafood".
